WHAT THIS REPOSITORY IS

A portfolio record. It documents how a delivered automation system was
designed, what it was built to prevent, and how it behaves when something
fails. It is written to be read.

WHAT YOU MAY DO

Read it. Link to it. Quote a short passage with attribution. Show it to a
colleague. That is what it is published for.

WHAT IS NOT PERMITTED

Copying, reproducing, republishing, modifying or redistributing the contents
of this repository in whole or in substantial part, or presenting this work
as your own.

The systems described here were built for paying clients. The
implementations — the workflow graphs, the execution order, the prompts, the
thresholds and the integration wiring — are not published here, and remain
with the engagements that commissioned them.

ANYTHING ELSE

